<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Strategy analysis {{ result.analysis_id }}</title><style>body{font:16px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif;color:#172333;background:#f5f7fa;margin:0}main{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:2rem}section{background:white;border:1px solid #dbe2ea;border-radius:10px;padding:1.3rem;margin:1rem 0}h1,h2{line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:1.2rem}.notice{border-left:4px solid #dc562e;padding-left:1rem}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#f4f6f8;padding:1rem;font-size:.8rem}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}dt{font-weight:600}dd{margin:0 0 .6rem}.charts{overflow:hidden}.muted{color:#536477}</style></head><body><main>
<h1>Race strategy decision</h1><p class="muted">{{ result.session_id }} · car {{ result.driver_number }} · after lap {{ result.completed_lap }}</p>
<p class="notice">{{ notice }} Forecasts are conditional; simulated outcomes are not observed race results.</p>
<section><h2>Decision and uncertainty</h2><dl><dt>Status</dt><dd>{{ result.status }}</dd><dt>Recommendation</dt><dd>{{ result.recommendation }}</dd><dt>Stay minus pit, seconds</dt><dd>{{ result.delta_stay_minus_pit_s if result.delta_stay_minus_pit_s is not none else 'Unavailable' }}</dd><dt>Probability pit is faster</dt><dd>{{ result.prob_pit_faster if result.prob_pit_faster is not none else 'Unavailable' }}</dd><dt>Comparison scope</dt><dd>{{ result.comparison_scope }}</dd></dl><h3>Intervals and Monte Carlo uncertainty</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.intervals) }}</pre><h3>Evidence and rationale</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.evidence) }}</pre></section>
<section class="charts"><h2>Forecast and paired simulation</h2>{% for chart in charts %}{{ chart | safe }}{% endfor %}</section>
<section><h2>Plans and sensitivities</h2><h3>Selected plan IDs</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.selected_plan_ids) }}</pre><h3>Screened candidates</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.candidate_summaries) }}</pre><h3>Fixed-plan sensitivity</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.sensitivity) }}</pre><h3>Rejoin and position</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.pit_exit_projection) }}\n{{ pretty(result.position_distribution) }}</pre></section>
<section><h2>Assumptions and quality</h2><p>Fuel and track effects are assumptions, not separately identified measurements. Inventory is not asserted historical inventory. The simulation does not model future retirements or red-flag restarts.</p><pre>{{ pretty(result.assumptions) }}\n{{ pretty(result.scenario) }}\n{{ pretty(result.quality_flags) }}</pre></section>
<section><h2>Provenance and replay prefix</h2><p>Analysis <code>{{ result.analysis_id }}</code><br>Snapshot <code>{{ result.snapshot_id }}</code><br>Model <code>{{ result.model_id }}</code><br>Model cutoff {{ result.model_data_cutoff_utc }} · {{ result.n_draws }} draws · seed {{ result.seed }}</p><h3>Source lineage</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.source_lineage) }}</pre><h3>Identity inputs</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.identity_inputs) }}</pre><h3>Released prefix</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.prefix_state) }}</pre><h3>Forecast support</h3><pre>{{ pretty(result.forecast_series) }}</pre></section>
</main></body></html>
